        <children xmi:type="notation:Shape" xmi:id="_ewDsULbIEeS6m7-8Vqqevw" type="Note" description="The Audio announcement is performed by the crew members using the aircraft built-in equipments (microphone, cabin speakers). The goal of the IFE is to forward the audio stream towards each Seat TV and to display an interruption message.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;This is why, from the IFE system point of view, Cabin Crew is actually not part of the scenario." fillColor="13369343" transparency="0" lineColor="6737151" lineWidth="1">
